{ dg-modules "genietransput" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Loops/Continue", ALGOL 68 solution loops-continue.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Loops/Continue#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/loops-continue.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Genie_Transput (
for i from 1 to 10 do
  print ((i,
    if i MOD 5 = 0 then
      new_line
    else
      ","
    fi
  ))
od
)
